# ----------resources----------
# Track ONLY the compiled rcc module (res/material_ct.py): every byte of the
# .qrc and of the svg/png/ico it packs is already inlined into that module, so
# tracking the sources too would store the same resources twice. This is the
# upstream GUI project's arrangement (see harness/docs/res-assets.md).
#
# The .qrc and the raw assets stay local (regenerate the module with
# `pyside6-rcc res/app.qrc -o res/material_ct.py`); the repo-root logo.png is
# the one original that IS tracked, because README.md shows it directly.
*.rcc
*.qrc
res/*.svg
res/*.png
res/*.ico

